units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential
velocity all create 600 12345 dist gaussian
timestep 0.001
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 0.01 iso 1 1 1
run 220000
